## Workflow Reference
Implements: ai_toolkit/workflows/feature-delivery/implement-phase.md

# Implement one phase

**Follow the workflow file verbatim.** This skill does not replace it.

## Args

```text
<feature|plan-path> [phase|next] [+tag -tag] [--load=a,b] [--full] [--commit]
```

`next` = first `Status: pending`. **Commit:** false unless `--commit` (then ask). `--no-commits` = default.

**Must run in Agent mode.** Never create a Cursor plan.

## Load (once; no INDEX.md)

1. `ai_toolkit/workflows/feature-delivery/implement-phase.md`
2. `ai_toolkit/LOADMAP.md` cards for phase `Load:` + `+tag` / `-tag` / `--load=` / `--full`
3. Live `plan.md` for this phase; feature `memory.md` when present; README **Contract** only; phase **Inputs** (reply `#ID` slices only)
4. `ai_docs/memory.md` when `app-memory` is loaded or a shared gotcha will be recorded
5. `design/screens/<slug>.md` before Figma MCP (per node)

Skip Tests in old plans. Ask gate = this phase’s Inputs only. Prefer uninterrupted implementation once Inputs suffice.

Read-once, explore subagent for broad search, 8 KB split to `history.md`. At handoff, replace rows in feature `memory.md` (≤ 3 KB) and shared facts in `ai_docs/memory.md` (≤ 4 KB). Do not append. Autopilot child: list facts, do not write. 10-line handoff with Context used.

Missing plan → `/feature-make-plan <feature>`.
